BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2c8917bc5a352cc5db1c3dd6
SUMMARY:The SpongeBob Musical
DTSTAMP:20261114T080300Z
DTSTART:20261115T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Based on the Nickelodeon animated television series SpongeBob S
	quarePants\, The SpongeBob Musical follows SpongeBob SquarePants’ attempts
	 to avert a volcanic eruption that could potentially wipe out all life in 
	Bikini Bottom. The musical has been called a "ginormous giggle of a show" 
	that provides a good amount of "giddy\, goofy fun" for all audiences. Help
	 bring Bikini Bottom to life with THEME NIGHTS! Friday\, November 13 – Ope
	ning Night: Kick off the fun with us for opening night! No theme\, just co
	me ready to have a great time! Saturday\, November 14 – Pirate Night: Arrr
	\, mateys! Grab your pirate gear and get ready for a night of swashbucklin
	g fun! Sunday\, November 15– SpongeBob Shirt Matinee: Who lives in a pinea
	pple under the sea? Show off your favorite SpongeBob shirt and join the fu
	n! Wednesday\, November 18 – Pink\, Yellow\, or Green Night: Pick your fav
	orite color—pink\, yellow\, or green—and brighten up the audience! Thursda
	y\, November 19 – Waves of Blue Night: Let’s turn the crowd into an ocean!
	 Wear your best blue and make waves with us! Friday\, November 20 – Hawaii
	an Shirt Night: Break out your brightest Hawaiian shirt and bring those tr
	opical vibes! Saturday\, November 21 – Disco Rodeo: Saddle up and get read
	y to boogie! Mix your country style with disco sparkle for a night of danc
	ing and fun!\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/cmt-spongebob
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/cmt-spongebob
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Theater
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
