BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2b9d8d92050c2646b0e03511
SUMMARY:CPI - Arc of Luminescence
DTSTAMP:20261114T080300Z
DTSTART:20270330T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Arc of Luminescence: A Full-Length Play by Michael Defrancesco 
	Synopsis: An artist/painter dies. His European collector\, executor\, and 
	live-in meet in NYC. The live-in reveals a private notebook in a locked de
	sk the painter has shared with no one. Its contents unleash a cascade of m
	oral challenges and destructive events. Playwright Bio: Michael Defrancesc
	o graduated with degrees in English and Theater Arts\, and afterwards\, he
	 taught high school for a few years. He fell into work with those living w
	ith developmental disabilities and later founded a residential housing pro
	gram for the developmentally disabled population. After attending a summer
	 drama program at the University of Cincinnati\, Michael was awarded a Roc
	kefeller Grant to UC’s Theatre Arts program\, where he earned a Master’s d
	egree. He began writing plays several years ago\, and Arc of Luminescence 
	is his fifth play selected for a reading with CPI. Michael has previously 
	had CPI staged readings of his plays The Circle\, The Car Ride\, The Hound
	\, and Thump.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/cpi-arc-of-l
	uminescence
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/cpi-arc-of-luminescence
LOCATION:Fifth Third Bank Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Theater
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ff96ff0a00fcb029d0e2ab4a
SUMMARY:Menopause The Musical®
DTSTAMP:20261114T080300Z
DTSTART:20270330T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Four women at a lingerie sale have nothing in common but a blac
	k lace bra AND memory loss\, hot flashes\, night sweats\, not enough sex\,
	 too much sex\, and more! This hilarious musical parody set to classic tun
	es from the ‘60s\, ‘70s\, and ‘80s will have you cheering and dancing in t
	he aisles! See what more than 17 million women and fans worldwide have bee
	n laughing about for 25 years! It's the Hilarious Celebration of Women and
	 The Change!®\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/menopause-th
	e-musical-27
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/menopause-the-musical-27
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Theater
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
